<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan CPI rises 0.4 percent in October.</title>
<headline>Moroccan CPI rises 0.4 percent in October.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's consumer price index rose 0.4 percent to 147.4 points in October from 146.8 in September, the Statistics Directorate said on Monday.</p>
<p>It attributed the increase to a 0.6 percent rise in food product costs and a 0.5 percent rise in the cost of other goods and services.</p>
<p>Consumer prices in January-October were 2.8 percent above the level a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
